    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d357-a3">

                <pb facs="0554" n="484" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg484"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure No. 3.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>Señor Oriega to General
                        Huerta</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York,</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-07-24"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >July</hi> 24, 1866</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In the exercise of ample power for such purposes, I have given permission to Dr.
                    William H. McKee to coin in the city of San Francisco, California, United
                    States, money having the <pb facs="0555" n="485" xml:id="pg485"/> form, value
                    and legality of the Mexican currency, on the conditions which you will settle in
                    accordance with the instructions which I have given you. I reserve to myself the
                    ratification of the contract. For this purpose I hereby commission and authorize
                    you to act in the premises, and this note shall serve as your credentials
                    therefor.</p>
                <p>Independence and constitution!</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JESUS G. ORTEGA, <hi rendition="#italic">Constitutional President of the
                            Mexican Republic.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Citizens General <hi rendition="#small-caps">Epitacio Huerta,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Governor of Michoacan,</hi> and <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Fernando Maria Ortega,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Governor of Puebla.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
